{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>WhatsApp 正測試一種有聲貼圖格式，收件人點按貼圖時會播放聲音。WABetaInfo 在 Android 應用程式的 Beta 版本中發現這項功能；與 WhatsApp 一貫做法一樣，新功能先在 Android Beta 推出，之後或會登陸 iPhone，時間由數星期至數月不等，視乎 Beta 測試進度。</p>\n<h2>有聲貼圖製作與播放</h2>\n<p>用戶可從一系列標準貼圖中選擇，亦可自行製作有聲貼圖：從相簿選取一段影片後，WhatsApp 會自動把它轉為動態貼圖。編輯器頂部新增聲音按鈕，點按後會顯示「Add sound」畫面，讓用戶選擇要附加至貼圖的音軌。聲音不會自動播放；收件人會看到貼圖上有小音訊圖示，點按後才會播放聲音。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 WhatsApp 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1266\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Whatsapp-Feature-1.jpg\" width=\"2250\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://wabetainfo.com/whatsapp-is-rolling-out-new-sound-sticker-messages-on-android/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:43:56.755246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:37:52.945086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T13:37:27.955092+00:00","content_hash":"62fb05d5a372ea7fbf0090a802bfce089b5d2a4d8134b0250d636696323bf9dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}